OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FMillions of households are set to see
OL,7,Funexpected increases to their water
OL,8,Fbills after the industry watchdog gave
OL,9,Fsuppliers the provisional go-ahead for
OL,10,Fan extra #3.4 billion in spending.
OL,12,FOfwat said five of 13 suppliers across
OL,13,FEngland and Wales are set to be given
OL,14,Fpermission to increase charges for
OL,15,Fcustomers to pump in the additional
OL,16,Finvestment by the end of the decade to
OL,17,Fhelp upgrade networks to cope with new
OL,18,Fhousing and data centres, and tackle
OL,19,Fforever chemicals to ensure drinking
OL,20,Fwater is safe and reliable.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FDebt-laden Thames Water is one of the
OL,7,Ffirms provisionally allowed to
OL,8,Fincrease customer bills between 2027
OL,9,Fand 2030, alongside Severn Trent
OL,10,FWater, Southern Water, Wessex Water
OL,11,Fand South East Water.
OL,13,FIt will likely stoke further anger,
OL,14,Fwith the water sector repeatedly under
OL,15,Ffire over rising bills at a time of
OL,16,Fpoor performance for sewage spills,
OL,17,Fwater quality and supply failures.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FThe Consumer Council for Water (CCW),
OL,7,Fwhich represents customers, said the
OL,8,Fdecision comes as households are
OL,9,Falready struggling with wider cost-of-
OL,10,Fliving pressures, adding Ofwat needs
OL,11,Fto show "every pound of this
OL,12,Fadditional #3.4 billion is necessary".
OL,14,FOfwat has already allowed water firms
OL,15,Fto put up bills by 36% between 2025
OL,16,Fand 2030, with eye-watering increases
OL,17,Fseen in 2025 and another 5.4% on
OL,18,Faverage from April this year.
OL,26,@sD@IOUtD@eO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham took aim
OL,7,Fat Ofwat's draft decision and said
OL,8,Fcustomers "cannot be treated as a
OL,9,Fblank cheque".
OL,11,FHe said: "I understand why people are
OL,12,Fangry ` I am too.
OL,14,F"The truth is customers have been
OL,15,Fasked to pay more for years, yet
OL,16,Fserious pollution incidents are at
OL,17,Frecord levels and the pipes are still
OL,18,Fleaking.
OL,26,@pD@KOUqD@MO]sD@JOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,F"None of which is the billpayer's
OL,7,Ffault, who should not be treated as a
OL,8,Fbottomless source of funding for other
OL,9,Fpeople's failures.
OL,11,F"Customers cannot be treated as a
OL,12,Fblank cheque. Where water companies
OL,13,Fseek to pass unnecessary costs on to
OL,14,Fhouseholds, they will be challenged.
OL,16,F"Our water industry has clearly not
OL,17,Fbeen working for people for far too
OL,18,Flong. That's why this Government will
OL,19,Fbe looking at how we can give the
OL,20,Fpublic more control and help keep
OL,21,Fbills as low as possible."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU}D@ZO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FThe decision sees additional bill
OL,7,Fincreases allowed for Thames Water `
OL,8,FBritain's biggest water supplier with
OL,9,Faround 16 million customers ` which is
OL,10,Fon the brink of collapse as it sinks
OL,11,Funder a more than #20 billion debt
OL,12,Fmountain with creditors looking to
OL,13,Fsecure a rescue deal to stave off
OL,14,Ftemporary nationalisation by the
OL,15,FGovernment.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FSouth East Water, which is also set to
OL,7,Fincrease bills for the investment
OL,8,Fprogramme, is another in the line of
OL,9,Ffire after a series of supply
OL,10,Finterruptions that has left thousands
OL,11,Fof households, businesses and schools
OL,12,Fwithout water.
OL,14,FSteve Hobbs, senior policy lead at the
OL,15,FCCW, said: "Customers want investment
OL,16,Fthat delivers cleaner rivers, more
OL,17,Freliable water supplies and
OL,18,Finfrastructure fit for the future.
OL,26,@wD@LOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,F"But that ambition must be balanced
OL,7,Fagainst the fact many households are
OL,8,Falready really struggling with higher
OL,9,Fwater bills and wider cost-of-living
OL,10,Fpressures.
OL,12,F"Ofwat needs to be able to show that
OL,13,Fevery pound of this additional #3.4
OL,14,Fbillion is necessary, delivers value
OL,15,Ffor money and is not funding work
OL,16,Fwater companies should have already
OL,17,Fhave paid for.
OL,19,F"Trust in water companies has never
OL,20,Fbeen lower and customers need to see
OL,21,Ftheir money is being well spent."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU{D@AOU}D@aO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969105
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FThe draft determination follows a
OL,7,Fthree-month review by Ofwat, with the
OL,8,F13 firms originally putting forward
OL,9,Frequests for further investment of
OL,10,F#4.3 billion.
OL,12,FA spokesman for Water UK, which
OL,13,Frepresents suppliers, said: "This
OL,14,Fsummer's drought has shown exactly why
OL,15,Fnew investment is so vital. This
OL,16,Fexpenditure will help to safeguard
OL,17,Fservices, unlock new homes and
OL,18,Fbusiness growth, and replace ageing
OL,19,Finfrastructure.
OL,26,@uD@]OU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969106
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,F"For most customers there will be no
OL,7,Fimmediate impact on bills. Where bills
OL,8,Fwill rise, we recognise any increase
OL,9,Fis difficult and help is available for
OL,10,Fanyone struggling to pay."
OL,12,FEnvironment Secretary Angela Eagle
OL,13,Fbranded regulation of the water sector
OL,14,F"toothless" and pledged to
OL,15,F"fundamentally reform" it.
OL,17,FShe said: "I know that households
OL,18,Facross the country are watching every
OL,19,Fpound and I share their frustration
OL,20,Fthat years of underinvestment and
OL,21,Ftoothless regulation has led to this."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@ZO]vD@AOUvD@KO]wD@AOUwD@VO]yD@
OL,26,AKOU}D@fO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969106
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,FOfwat will consult on the draft
OL,7,Fdecision until September 24, with a
OL,8,Ffinal verdict due in December.
OL,10,FHelen Campbell, executive director for
OL,11,Fdelivery at Ofwat, said: "The newly
OL,12,Fagreed funding will help unlock much-
OL,13,Fneeded new housing development and
OL,14,Fboost business growth across a range
OL,15,Fof sectors, as well as improving
OL,16,Fdrinking water quality and the removal
OL,17,Fof PFAS and forever chemicals.
OL,26,@sD@ZOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786969106
OL,3,CThames Water customers set to see bill
OL,4,Cincrease
OL,6,F"We will track performance to ensure
OL,7,Fcompanies are delivering the expected
OL,8,Fimprovements for customers and the
OL,9,Fenvironment.
OL,11,F"If they don't, expenditure can be
OL,12,Fclawed back."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUtD@MO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/12
